{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y反复使用“他因……”的句式，容易让情绪表达变得解释化、程式化，少了X那种自然流动的细腻感。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把人物的心理动因和情绪变化压缩成更容易即时理解的表达，尤其是每段之间为什么发生变化、前一段如何引出后一段，都比X更容易扫出来。新增的小字也补足了几个关键的心理转折，使观众不必完全依赖推断就能理解人物。不过，X在情绪质感、矛盾心理和细微感受上更丰富，Y有些地方把复杂的心绪整理成了过于明确的因果结论，损失了一点含蓄和余韵。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "492d7e19-acff-4289-9373-2344702c0022", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T195054659704Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:51:28.344765+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "36b1ce27ba1d871d1f02396de0c5a73ae12854ee6be90b3eda8a8b78724f04f6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa